You will be part of the Fab infra and Pre-install team (FIPI Team) which is a part of Development and Engineering (D&E) sector of ASML. This team strives to deliver with quality and on time to customer the information needed to design, build and qualify the factory (building, utilities, etc.) needed to house an ASML machine. This information (over 30.000 data elements) is actively collected from the cross-functional teams designing the (new) ASML machines. It is very important that the information is complete, correct and consistent.
